# vehje-codegen. output machinery

The framework's output side: one generic fold over the Core substrate
plus a program's families, the `Target` plug-in contract (a target
declares the family set it `Supports` and the effect set it `Permits`),
the inclusion and effect checks that gate emission on the target's
declaration, and compile-time target composition. No `dyn`; a
distribution composes its targets and a generated match resolves a
target name to a monomorphised emit.
